	"VersionName": "1.0.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Assetpro Lobby Kit",
	"Description": "A style-neutral multiplayer front end built on CommonUI: play hub, host game, server browser, lobby with teams and ready-up, matchmaking queue, party, friends, text chat, scoreboard, results and connection dialogs, driven by a Blueprintable online provider (engine Online Subsystem sessions by default: LAN games out of the box, a platform service by config). Also a complete menu system: main menu, settings, pause, save and load slots, chapter select, credits, loading screen and HUD essentials. For mouse, keyboard and gamepad. Translated into 11 languages. Re-skin everything from a single Theme data asset (three skins included).",
	"Category": "User Interface",
	"CreatedBy": "CodeLikeMe",
